# Generated by expo prebuild. This is a CNG project: EAS runs prebuild on the
# build machine, and a local one (to verify plugins/withCertPinning.js, say)
# leaves a copy behind that must not be committed -- a stale checked-in android/
# silently overrides every config plugin.
